docs {
  # Lists all available metric data points, matching the specified parameters

  **Deprecated**

  Provides advanced filtering possibilities, comparing to the `GET /timeseries/{metricIdentifier}` request.

  **Auth:** Api-Token only (OAuth not supported by this endpoint). Uses `{{DT_API_TOKEN}}`.

  **API token scopes:** DataExport
}
